Since you said you might wish for the Eye, I'm assuming your character
is Neutral.  The following are two wishes that you might want to
consider:

The Platinum Yendorian Express Card: In addition to conferring magic
resistance, it also gives you a permanent light source, since you can
#invoke this artifact to refill your lamps.  It is also very helpful in
the ascension run, since you can use it to charge wands of death and
teleportation.

The Eyes of the Overworld: In addition to conferring magic resistance,
it also gives you astral vision, which is arguably better than a light
source, because astral vision works through walls.  You could also
#invoke this artifact to determine if it is safe to pray, which is very
useful since it will allow you to pray much more often.



